            <ArticleTitle>Homolateral hourglass-like constrictions of the axillary and suprascapular nerves: case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1815-20</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.jhsa.2009.07.016</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In contrast with previous research, it was recently demonstrated that hourglass-like constriction is not exclusive to the elbow region. We present a report of a patient who had an axillary nerve and a suprascapular nerve hourglass-like constriction, found 7 years apart.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
